OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 80s dies three days after
OL,4,Avillage crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has begun after a man
OL,7,Fin his 80s died following a crash
OL,8,Fbetween two cars.
OL,10,FA white Skoda Superb and a black
OL,11,FMercedes Benz crashed on Plough Road in
OL,12,FGreat Bentley, Essex, just before 20:00
OL,13,FBST on Friday.
OL,15,FThe Skoda driver was taken to hospital
OL,16,Ffor treatment but died in hospital on
OL,17,FMonday, police said.
OL,19,FOfficers have urged anyone who might
OL,20,Fhave information about the incident, or
OL,21,Fhas relevant dashcam footage, to come
OL,22,Fforward.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
